{"title":"트리플 바카","artist":"라마즈","sourceId":"reference:XRqNLfkrE3zG2999NXF3","sourceHash":"27803487b46718272664cb468b77e95f220aae0a1f18ae60cd9a24b524fd7ec7","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":23282682,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":3.99,"end":16.19,"text":"あなたの心をバッキュンキュン！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.19,"end":20.18,"text":"気がつけばモニターの前で　おはよっ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":20.18,"end":26.78,"text":"しらないあいだに　ねむけ　あらわれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.78,"end":29.24,"text":"いそがしいのに　あまえながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":29.24,"end":33.04,"text":"よせる　言葉に誘われ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":33.04,"end":34.57,"text":"「きみは実にバカだなあ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":34.57,"end":37.45,"text":"「本気で釣られたあ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.45,"end":40.09,"text":"かんぺきにまにあわない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.09,"end":42.8,"text":"どうしようもないそのとき","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.8,"end":45.45,"text":"ひらめいたなにかにより","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":45.45,"end":47.93,"text":"すぐにあきらめた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.93,"end":49.2,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.2,"end":53.18,"text":"何がここまであなたをうごかすの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":53.18,"end":58.53,"text":"未知なる世界へ飛び立つ　希望乗せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":58.53,"end":59.85,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":59.85,"end":63.92,"text":"他にやることまだまだあるんじゃない？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":63.92,"end":69.44,"text":"ないて　わらって　おこること　任せてね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":69.44,"end":82.78,"text":"わたしの色にしてあげる♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":82.78,"end":86.73,"text":"クリエイティブな心は折れないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":86.73,"end":91.65,"text":"そうは言うけれど　すでにくずれてた♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":91.65,"end":93.46000000000001,"text":"「おい、それはだめだろ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":93.46000000000001,"end":95.93,"text":"なあに　またもちなおせば　ほら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":95.93,"end":99.24000000000001,"text":"やる気　たくさんあふれる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":99.24000000000001,"end":104.0,"text":"すなどけいのように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":104.0,"end":106.84,"text":"てきとーにつくりあげる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":106.84,"end":109.47999999999999,"text":"だけどなにかものたりず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":109.47999999999999,"end":112.11,"text":"ネタをさがしてみたけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":112.11,"end":114.63,"text":"ちからつきてきた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":114.63,"end":115.92,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":115.92,"end":120.03,"text":"まちぼうけなのに　てぬきとかひどいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":120.03,"end":125.23,"text":"本気だせば　幸せでしょ？　あなたなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":125.23,"end":126.51,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":126.51,"end":130.68,"text":"やるべきことは　すべてわすれちゃえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":130.68,"end":136.07999999999998,"text":"うたう　おどる　えがく　ことば　おくりだす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":136.07999999999998,"end":167.73,"text":"わたしのために　おｋ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":167.73,"end":171.8,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":171.8,"end":175.97,"text":"何がここまであなたをうごかすの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":175.97,"end":181.13,"text":"未知なる世界へ飛び立つ　希望乗せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":181.13,"end":182.48,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":182.48,"end":186.64,"text":"他にやることまだまだあるんじゃない？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":186.64,"end":191.76,"text":"ないて　わらって　おこること　任せてね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":191.76,"end":193.32,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":193.32,"end":197.27,"text":"まちぼうけなのに　てぬきとかひどいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":197.27,"end":202.49,"text":"本気だせば　幸せでしょ？　あなたなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":202.49,"end":203.8,"text":"バカ　バカ　バカ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":203.8,"end":207.84,"text":"やるべきことは　すべてわすれちゃえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":207.84,"end":213.41,"text":"うたう　おどる　えがく　ことば　おくりだす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":213.41,"end":220.59,"text":"あなたの色にしてあげりゅうううううううううう♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}